{"title":"어차피 본능 [19세 완전판]","thumbnail":null,"synopsis":"왜 또 내 눈에 띄어서는.그래. 인정한다.더는 소녀가 아닌, 저 여자를 욕망한다.그는 순진한 고양이를 새장 안에 구겨 넣었다.“내 새장 안에 살아. 나만 보면서.”유혹은 쉬웠다.*설구원. 금수저. 잘난 대통령의 손자.나, 오여름. 도움이 간절한 힘없는 의대생.“내 손 잡아. 도와줄게.”구원은 달콤한 눈빛으로 여름에게 손을 내밀었다.아름다운 구원인 줄 알았다. 하지만 그의 다정함도 어차피 본능일 뿐이라면,계약에 불과한 관계에 사랑 따윈 개나 주라지.더는 잘난 개자식의 새장에서 울지 않기로 했다.#계약관계 #몸정>맘정 #애증 #재회 #나쁜남자 #절륜남 #후회남#집착남 #능력남 #상처녀 #순정녀 #도망녀 #절륜녀 #신파 #메디컬 #쌍방구원","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":277,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":266,"change":{"type":"up","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-10-26","rank":65,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-27","rank":63,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-10-28","rank":34,"change":{"type":"up","amount":29}},{"date":"2026-10-29","rank":55,"change":{"type":"down","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-10-30","rank":62,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-10-31","rank":62,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-11-01","rank":74,"change":{"type":"down","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-11-02","rank":88,"change":{"type":"down","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-11-03","rank":104,"change":{"type":"down","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-11-04","rank":113,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-11-05","rank":151,"change":{"type":"down","amount":38}},{"date":"2026-11-06","rank":177,"change":{"type":"down","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-11-07","rank":168,"change":{"type":"up","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-11-08","rank":175,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-11-09","rank":174,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-11-10","rank":174,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-10-26","rank":117,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-27","rank":76,"change":{"type":"up","amount":41}},{"date":"2026-10-28","rank":44,"change":{"type":"up","amount":32}},{"date":"2026-10-29","rank":41,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}